## Codebase Patterns
- The component uses `WebComponent.create('image-editor')` for registration.
- Authored light-DOM content is captured in `connectedCallback()` before the
  base class invokes `render()`.

## 2026-08-25 01:45 - US-001
- Implemented `ImageEditor` to capture the first child image and render it in
  a relative `.image-editor-container`; missing images render nothing and log
  a debug warning.
- Updated the example, browser tests, CSS defaults, architecture documents,
  and PRD completion flag.
- Files changed: `src/index.ts`, `src/index.css`, `src/_vars.css`,
  `example/index.html`, `example/index.ts`, `test/index.ts`,
  `docs/architecture/runtime-component.md`,
  `docs/architecture/runtime-state.md`, `specs/prd.json`, `progress.log`.
- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - The base class invokes subclass `render()` from
    `super.connectedCallback()`.
  - Browser tests run through `npm test`; direct binaries are not on the
    shell PATH outside npm scripts.
